{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19204","headline":"寄和东川杨尚书慕巢兼寄西川继之二公近从弟兄情分偏睦早忝游旧因成是诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"寄和东川杨尚书慕巢兼寄西川继之二公近从弟兄情分偏睦早忝游旧因成是诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太华莲峰降岳灵，两川棠树接郊垧。\n政同兄弟人人乐，曲奏埙篪处处听。\n杨叶百穿荣会府，芝泥五色耀天庭。\n各抛笔砚夸旄钺，莫遣文星让将星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}